Z||000007||Songman||07-17-2001||01:36 AM||||I'm dying to know what the picture is!<P>If you uploaded your picture to the server with pip, the actual URL you should use is <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/xxxxx" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/xxxxx</A>  with xxxx being whatever the name of your file was. And of course all of this in the UBB code brackets... [IMG] and [/IMG]<P>Open PIP. Click on History. Find the pic you want to show and click on the button with the filename below the pic. Then highlight the URL that shows in the bottom window where it says Clipboard Contents. Copy this and put it inside the brackets as shown above. This should show your picture...<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
